<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal state-set prices to rise less than 2 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal state-set prices to rise less than 2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices set by the Portuguese state will rise by an average of less than two percent for each utility or service next year, a cabinet spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Prices set by the government include water, electricity, postal services and public transport.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
